<main class="content"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Contenus visuels</p><h1>Galerie multimédia</h1><p>Organisez les photos et vidéos qui racontent Madagascar.</p></div><div class="actions"><button class="button secondary" id="add-photo" type="button">＋ Ajouter une photo</button><button class="button" id="add-video" type="button">＋ Ajouter une vidéo</button></div></div>
<div class="kpi-grid"><article class="kpi"><span class="kpi-icon">▧</span><div><div class="kpi-label">Total des médias</div><div class="kpi-value" id="kpi-total">0</div><div class="kpi-note">Photos et vidéos</div></div></article><article class="kpi"><span class="kpi-icon warm">▣</span><div><div class="kpi-label">Photos</div><div class="kpi-value" id="kpi-images">0</div><div class="kpi-note">Images de Madagascar</div></div></article><article class="kpi"><span class="kpi-icon purple">▷</span><div><div class="kpi-label">Vidéos</div><div class="kpi-value" id="kpi-videos">0</div><div class="kpi-note">Clips et découvertes</div></div></article><article class="kpi"><span class="kpi-icon green">✓</span><div><div class="kpi-label">Médias publiés</div><div class="kpi-value" id="kpi-published">0</div><div class="kpi-note" id="kpi-draft-note">0 brouillon(s)</div></div></article></div><p class="notice" id="notice" role="status"></p>
<section class="panel hidden" id="media-form-panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2 id="form-title">Ajouter un média</h2><p>JPG, PNG, WebP (10 Mo), vidéo MP4/WebM (100 Mo) ou lien YouTube/Vimeo.</p></div><button class="button secondary hidden" id="cancel-edit" type="button">Annuler la modification</button></div><form id="media-form" enctype="multipart/form-data">
<input type="hidden" name="id"><div class="row">
<label class="field">Type de média<select name="media_type" id="media-type"><option value="image">Photo</option><option value="video">Vidéo</option></select></label>
<label class="field">Source vidéo<select name="video-source" id="video-source"><option value="external">Lien YouTube / Vimeo</option><option value="upload">Fichier vidéo</option></select></label>
</div>
